  "details": "1. Wear an avatar that has GoGo Loco\n\n2. Change pose / height using GoGo Loco\n\n2. Turn Safe Mode on (or off).\n\nWhat is expected: \n\n- player's avatar is not affected and stays in the same pose as before\n\nWhat is happening actually: \n\n- all GoGo Loco parameters resets to default\n\nIt happens on PC version and on Android mobile app (on every build). I haven't tested on another platforms.\n\nAnd it seems like it's a common problem, it happens with every avatar and I havent seen an avatar that is not affected by that.",
